      "transcript_en": "GTA VI will take us 80 hours to complete, and the story will be unfolding in chapters just like in Redel Redemption 2. We know that because Rob Nelson, the head of development, said in the interview that he spent 80 hours to complete his playthrough of GTA VI. Just for comparison, GTA V took us 30 hours to complete Redel Redemption took us 50 to 60 hours, and GTA VI will take us 80 hours, which is just a lot. The game is so big that the developers in the interviews also said they can't take us everywhere on the map. It means that the whole story and side quests of GTA VI will not let us feel how big the map actually is, and till we explore it on our own, and I just love that idea. So in today's video, I tried to put GTA VI and Taya story in the correct order, but as small warning, this is just speculation, but based on trailers and screenshots.",
